Have you taken the document to Commander Derik yet?
I know your strength is spent, but I ask just this one more favor.

It has been a long journey to get here. You were key to this victory. The Pristonian continent is grateful for all your bravery.

The alliance between the Pristonians and the water people is stronger. Zarad will be a great leader for the water people.

Deliver the Top Secret Document to Commander Derik in Ricarten.
